{
  "name": "Client Onboarding Orchestrator (sample, UnpauseAI)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "client-onboarding",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0001-4a01-8a01-000000000001",
      "name": "New client intake (JotForm)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "client-onboarding"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "clientName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.client_name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "clientEmail",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "package",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.package }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0002-4a01-8a01-000000000002",
      "name": "Normalize client fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "project",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "=Onboarding: {{ $json.clientName }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0003-4a01-8a01-000000000003",
      "name": "Create onboarding project (Asana)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.asana",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [700, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "customer",
        "operation": "create",
        "displayName": "={{ $json.clientName }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "primaryEmailAddr": "={{ $json.clientEmail }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0004-4a01-8a01-000000000004",
      "name": "Create customer (QuickBooks)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.quickbooks",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "folder",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "=Client - {{ $json.clientName }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0005-4a01-8a01-000000000005",
      "name": "Create client folder (Drive)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [700, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1a1f001-0006-4a01-8a01-000000000006",
      "name": "Consolidate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [980, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "C0000000000",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=New client onboarded: {{ $json.clientName }}. Asana project, QuickBooks customer, and Drive folder created.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0007-4a01-8a01-000000000007",
      "name": "Notify team (Slack)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1420, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "record",
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Clients",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-0008-4a01-8a01-000000000008",
      "name": "Log to client tracker (Airtable)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1420, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Intake\nJotForm posts a new client to this webhook. The Set node normalizes the fields once, so every downstream node reads clean names (clientName, clientEmail, package) instead of raw form keys. One place to change if the form changes.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-1001-4a01-8a01-000000001001",
      "name": "Sticky: Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Create across the client's systems\nThree parallel branches create the records each tool needs: an Asana onboarding project, a QuickBooks customer, and a Google Drive folder. They run independently, then Consolidate waits for all three before anything is announced, so a half-finished onboarding is never reported as done.\n\nEach call should carry retry + continueOnFail in production, with failures routed to a review queue.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-1002-4a01-8a01-000000001002",
      "name": "Sticky: Create",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [600, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Notify & log\nOnce all three systems are set up, the team gets one Slack message and the client tracker in Airtable gets one row. Slack is for humans; Airtable is the durable record of who was onboarded and when.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1a1f001-1003-4a01-8a01-000000001003",
      "name": "Sticky: Notify and log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1340, 160]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New client intake (JotForm)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normalize client fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Normalize client fields": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "Create onboarding project (Asana)", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Create customer (QuickBooks)", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Create client folder (Drive)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    },
    "Create onboarding project (Asana)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Consolidate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Create customer (QuickBooks)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Consolidate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Create client folder (Drive)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Consolidate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Consolidate": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "Notify team (Slack)", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Log to client tracker (Airtable)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templatecredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Sample client-onboarding orchestrator. One JotForm intake fans out to Asana, QuickBooks, and Google Drive, consolidates, then notifies Slack and logs to Airtable. Prepared by UnpauseAI as a working example of documented n8n."
  },
  "tags": [{ "name": "sample" }, { "name": "onboarding" }]
}
